cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its archived results, please cite this repository."
title: "Temporal organization of intraday multifractality in XAUUSD: surrogates, temporal ablations, and conditional volatility models (reproducibility code)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Baldiviezo Romero"
    given-names: "Ramiro Junior"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-05"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ramirobaldiviezo532/xauusd-intraday-multifractality"
abstract: >-
  Google Colab analysis code and archived result tables for an empirical study
  of intraday XAUUSD multifractality during 2003–2026 using MF-DFA, surrogate
  data, temporal ablations, seasonal GARCH-t and FIGARCH-t benchmarks, and a
  secondary bipower-variation jump analysis. The repository contains an
  integrity manifest with SHA-256 checksums and reproducibility documentation.
keywords:
  - XAUUSD
  - econophysics
  - MF-DFA
  - multifractality
  - surrogate data
  - temporal ablations
  - conditional volatility
  - GARCH
